  "statuteText": "656:15 Paper. –\n\nThe state general election ballot shall be printed on plain white paper in weight not less than that of ordinary printing paper. A constitutional question submitted on a separate ballot shall be printed on colored paper, or on plain white paper with a printed, colored header."
